SUMMARY:Feast of Agioi Konstantinos and Eleni\, Nea Styra
LOCATION:Nea Styra\, Evia (South)\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The parish church of the seaside resort of Nea Styra is dedicated to Constantine and Helen and keeps 20-21 May with an episcopal vespers and liturgy (two metropolitans in 2025)\, the informal start of the season on this stretch of coast opposite Attica. Religious rather than a glenti\, but the tavernas on the front open for it.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/evia-south/#nea-styra-feast-of-agioi-konstantinos-and-eleni-nea-styra
